## Phase 5: Polished Modern Frontend & Live Webcam Integration

In **Phase 5**, the React + Vite frontend was built into a modern, accessible dark-themed web portal with real-time webcam gesture capture, debounced sign prediction, and text accumulation.

### 1. Key Components & Pages Created

- **[CameraPanel.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/CameraPanel.jsx)**:
  - Manages browser webcam feed via `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia`.
  - Horizontally mirrors video for intuitive webcam user experience (`transform: scaleX(-1)`).
  - Exposes `captureFrame()` via `forwardRef` and `useImperativeHandle` using a hidden `<canvas>` element.
  - Implements defensive error boundaries: Permission Denied (`NotAllowedError`), Device Not Found (`NotFoundError`), and Track In Use (`NotReadableError`).
  - Provides visual empty state with camera icon and "Start Camera" CTA.
- **[PredictionCard.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/PredictionCard.jsx)**:
  - Prominently displays the recognized letter (e.g. `A`).
  - Animated confidence bar with color gradation (>80% cyan/blue, >50% amber, <50% muted).
  - Hand status badge showing whether 21 skeletal landmarks are actively tracked.
  - Helpful context messages: "Show your hand in the camera", "Analyzing...", and "Unable to connect to recognition service".
- **[RecognizedText.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/RecognizedText.jsx)**:
  - Accumulates sequences of letters into words/sentences with a blinking monospace cursor.
  - Controls: Text-to-Speech (`Speak` via Web Speech API), Clipboard `Copy`, and `Clear Text`.
- **[ControlBar.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/ControlBar.jsx)**:
  - Toolbar for Start/Stop Camera, Pause/Resume Recognition, Space, Backspace, and Clear Text.
- **[StatusBadge.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/StatusBadge.jsx)**:
  - Reusable subtle status pills (`active`, `paused`, `inactive`, `error`).
- **[Navbar.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/components/Navbar.jsx)**:
  - Brand identity: `ISL Translator`.
  - Navigation links for `Home`, `Translator`, `History`, `About`.
  - Responsive collapsible mobile navigation drawer.
- **[Translator.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/pages/Translator.jsx)**:
  - Main workspace layout: 60–65% camera panel, 35–40% prediction stack.
  - Prediction loop with ~400ms interval and in-flight request guard (`isProcessingRef`) to prevent overlapping frames.
  - Gesture debouncing: requires 3 consecutive frames of the same sign (~1.2s hold) before appending to avoid spamming.
- **[Home.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/pages/Home.jsx)**:
  - Hero banner with "Start Translating" CTA.
  - 3-step feature breakdown: Show Your Hand $\to$ Detect Hand Landmarks $\to$ Recognize the Sign.
- **[About.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/pages/About.jsx)**:
  - Project purpose, Indian Sign Language accessibility context, MediaPipe 21 landmark extraction, and Random Forest classification.
- **[History.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/pages/History.jsx)**:
  - Clean empty state ready for upcoming database session logging.
- **[App.jsx](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/App.jsx)**:
  - Root shell connecting navigation state, page views, and global footer.
- **[index.css](file:///d:/college/Projects/ISL_Translator/client/src/styles/index.css)**:
  - Curated dark color scheme: deep navy (`#090d16`), charcoal surfaces (`#0f172a`), indigo/blue accents (`#3b82f6`), soft borders, smooth transitions, and responsive grid layouts.

